CODEGEN.md §2.2, §4.4, decision 37, clean: E8012 judges only a value an emit writes; a types-mode emit writes none and a baked emit writes only its `values`, so a Range and a list of Range that no emit writes check clean. (A function-typed value is E3306 before stage E, TYPES.md §12.3.)
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A span.
let span: Range = 1..3

/// Spans.
let spans: [Range] = [1..2, 4..]

/// A count.
let count: Int = 3

emit cpp { out: "@features/ac", namespace: "a", mode: types }
emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a", values: [count] }
